The common-goods NPC (CommonGoods:1) in every kingdom shop now lists
all 147 rows at price 0. The kingdom NPC (CommonGoods:0) will have
(nearly) nothing left — talk to the common-goods shopkeeper.
Price 0 is probably safe (the save lookup does not take a price) but
is NOT proven — verify on device. See REPORT-SHOP-ALL-FREE.md.
